Create a new local LaTeX project directory containing main.tex and remember it as the main document. Use this by default when the user asks for a new TeX file or document, so images, sections and bibliography files can be added inside the same project. Never overwrites an existing directory. Honor explicit requested paths and edits to existing documents. After creation use open_in_codex with the returned project folder and compile_latex_document to check the result. Add images as ordinary files inside the project, normally in images/, and reference them relative to the main document. Available for local Work and Codex. This tool is part of plugin `codex-app-tools`.

