  // Shown to the user as the label of this call. Write it first, before `input` or `edits`. A short, specific phrase of 3-8 words starting with an imperative verb that says what this call does to the design, e.g. "Add pricing section with 3 tiers", "Fix header alignment", "Generate hero illustration". No trailing period.
